{"reference":"2 Samuel 22","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":22,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Within 2 Samuel","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"This song stands within a book that moves from David’s accession and the consolidation of his kingdom through the ark and the promise of a dynasty, then into royal abuse, violence within his household, rebellion, and grief, before a four-part closing appendix. That wider movement places David’s words of deliverance in a narrative that includes both triumph and deep conflict.","verse_refs":[],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_022_b5502a6330c6440c96b118fd"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}